-In the case of the {es} log a more complete Grok pattern is
-`\[%{TIMESTAMP_ISO8601:timestamp}\]\[%{LOGLEVEL:loglevel} *\]\[%{JAVACLASS:class} *\] \[%{HOSTNAME:node}\] %{JAVALOGMESSAGE:message}`.
